    "detailed_description": "The Empanada Protocol is a short, but brutal presicion platformer where you play as an Empanada (A delicious piece of chilean cuisine) trying to escape the security protocol of a shady underground facility. The place is filled with traps and fun gimmicks that will test your reacction time and presicion. Do you have the will power and skill to escape?<br />\r\nThis game also includes:<br />\r\n- Empanada de pino<br />\r\n- Butter<br />\r\n- Flying knives<br />\r\n- Fun or Anger",
